(6978398, 1053442, 20608, '<td valign="top">This is very convincing has all the elements of one of my favourite photographers on DPC.. In fact, I''m gonna declare this as my top pick and state I think this is the man himself... 10</td>', 'This is very convincing has all the elements of one of my favourite photographers on DPC.. In fact, I''m gonna declare this as my top pick and state I think this is the man himself... 10', '2013-02-13 08:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
