(6978410, 1052963, 138253, '<td valign="top">I love the range and depth of this image. Walking by here and seeing this all in daylight would likely look garish, but the tones here turn this into a true piece of art.</td>', 'I love the range and depth of this image. Walking by here and seeing this all in daylight would likely look garish, but the tones here turn this into a true piece of art.', '2013-02-13 08:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
