(6978713, 1053203, 96751, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood of this, and the sense of wonderment from him in an obviously abandoned place. But the balance, composition and crop are off for me. I also feel the lighting is just a bit flat, especially for a "Jagar" image. To my eye it needs more contrast.</td>', 'I really like the mood of this, and the sense of wonderment from him in an obviously abandoned place. But the balance, composition and crop are off for me. I also feel the lighting is just a bit flat, especially for a "Jagar" image. To my eye it needs more contrast.', '2013-02-13 14:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978715, 1053049, 96751, '<td valign="top">What is this place????? I like the negative space, although the waves seem a bit oversharpened, and she is a little lost in the vastness. I wish you''d dodged her just a bit</td>', 'What is this place????? I like the negative space, although the waves seem a bit oversharpened, and she is a little lost in the vastness. I wish you''d dodged her just a bit', '2013-02-13 14:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
