(6978773, 1053515, 96751, '<td valign="top">This might be my favorite image in the challenge. Although I don''t normally think of landscapes/nature as his subject, this is what I think it would look like if he did. Just gorgeous, the lines, the combination of straights and rounds, verticals and horizontals... I adore this.<br/> <br/>Of course, it''s entirely plausible that this IS John''s work :-)</td>', 'This might be my favorite image in the challenge. Although I don''t normally think of landscapes/nature as his subject, this is what I think it would look like if he did. Just gorgeous, the lines, the combination of straights and rounds, verticals and horizontals... I adore this. Of course, it''s entirely plausible that this IS John''s work :-)', '2013-02-13 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
