(6978938, 1052963, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Very interest crew of characters in this one. And the lighting and processing are fabulous!</td>', 'Very nice capture. Very interest crew of characters in this one. And the lighting and processing are fabulous!', '2013-02-13 20:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978940, 1053405, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is very much in the style of Jagar, with good tones and a great street shot. The technicals are there with a great DoF and focus is spot on. The light is just right on the person while the shadows are nice and black. If there are any critiques to make it would be the man''s feet are cut off just below the knees and kind of look like stumps. I think the rule of thumb is include the whole person or do a three quarter portrait above the knee line. Jagar lives in a unique part of the world which has the old European style, you did well to match that setting.</td>', 'I think this is very much in the style of Jagar, with good tones and a great street shot. The technicals are there with a great DoF and focus is spot on. The light is just right on the person while the shadows are nice and black. If there are any critiques to make it would be the man''s feet are cut off just below the knees and kind of look like stumps. I think the rule of thumb is include the whole person or do a three quarter portrait above the knee line. Jagar lives in a unique part of the world which has the old European style, you did well to match that setting.', '2013-02-13 20:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978941, 1053528, 124982, '<td valign="top">This man has so much character to him. Love the beard!! Nicely captured and processed!</td>', 'This man has so much character to him. Love the beard!! Nicely captured and processed!', '2013-02-13 20:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978942, 1053540, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this light is indicative of the lighting Jagar often shoots in.</td>', 'I think this light is indicative of the lighting Jagar often shoots in.', '2013-02-13 20:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978943, 1053467, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.', '2013-02-13 20:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978945, 1053494, 124982, '<td valign="top">Superbly lit and processed. Just love the rich blacks!</td>', 'Superbly lit and processed. Just love the rich blacks!', '2013-02-13 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978946, 1053523, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this pose is indicative of Jagars style. I see a lot of his subjects walking while looking at the camera. You did good with that. I think the rule of thumb for the composition is either include the full length of the person, feet and all, or take a 3/4 portrait above the knee. The legs kind of look like stumps if you don''t get the feet.</td>', 'I think this pose is indicative of Jagars style. I see a lot of his subjects walking while looking at the camera. You did good with that. I think the rule of thumb for the composition is either include the full length of the person, feet and all, or take a 3/4 portrait above the knee. The legs kind of look like stumps if you don''t get the feet.', '2013-02-13 20:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978948, 1053540, 124982, '<td valign="top">The processing on this is sublime! Such beautiful tones!</td>', 'The processing on this is sublime! Such beautiful tones!', '2013-02-13 20:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978949, 1053455, 124982, '<td valign="top">Has the feel for a jagar image, but lacks the deeper hook. Very close, though!</td>', 'Has the feel for a jagar image, but lacks the deeper hook. Very close, though!', '2013-02-13 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978950, 1053441, 10785, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going with this. This certain type of sepia coloring has been done by Jagar is several of his color shots. You did well to match it.</td>', 'I can see where you were going with this. This certain type of sepia coloring has been done by Jagar is several of his color shots. You did well to match it.', '2013-02-13 20:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978953, 1053504, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good tones which are indicative of Jagar''s style. I think the lighting is a little too even and diffuse though.</td>', 'Good tones which are indicative of Jagar''s style. I think the lighting is a little too even and diffuse though.', '2013-02-13 20:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978954, 1053497, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait! Nice lighting!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait! Nice lighting!', '2013-02-13 20:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
