(6978971, 1052839, 124982, '<td valign="top">I so badly want to say this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a> image. It''s the right kind of subject, and the processing is FLAWLESS. This is my second guess for the John''s image...just narrowly beaten out by another. But definitely making me rethink.</td>', 'I so badly want to say this is a  jagar image. It''s the right kind of subject, and the processing is FLAWLESS. This is my second guess for the John''s image...just narrowly beaten out by another. But definitely making me rethink.', '2013-02-13 20:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
