(6980637, 1053542, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Not sure I like the vignette though. I think it''s because it''s centered but the subject isn''t so it acts like an artificial shadow being cast.</td>', 'Very sharp. Not sure I like the vignette though. I think it''s because it''s centered but the subject isn''t so it acts like an artificial shadow being cast.', '2013-02-17 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6980644, 1053426, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, but to be honest I could do without the title. If your goal is to be unequivocal then let your photo be the instrument. The title just makes it preachy.</td>', 'Cool photo, but to be honest I could do without the title. If your goal is to be unequivocal then let your photo be the instrument. The title just makes it preachy.', '2013-02-17 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
