(6980646, 1053200, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism you''ve achieved here but I''m not a fan of your processing choices. You''ve made the subject''s face appear nuclear in comparison to the rest of the surroundings. Very unnaturally looking.</td>', 'I like the minimalism you''ve achieved here but I''m not a fan of your processing choices. You''ve made the subject''s face appear nuclear in comparison to the rest of the surroundings. Very unnaturally looking.', '2013-02-17 14:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
