(6980754, 1053529, 41337, '<td valign="top">Had this been perfectly centered I''d probably accuse you of setting it up. The fact that it''s off kilter validates its authenticity. However, beyond that it simply works to tell the story. The hawk swoops in and before it can fully enter the frame it already has hold of its prey. It''s both documentary and art. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657190" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657190.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657190.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657190.gif"/></a></td>', 'Had this been perfectly centered I''d probably accuse you of setting it up. The fact that it''s off kilter validates its authenticity. However, beyond that it simply works to tell the story. The hawk swoops in and before it can fully enter the frame it already has hold of its prey. It''s both documentary and art.  ', '2013-02-17 19:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
