(6981134, 1052839, 30982, '<td valign="top">Tires need a bit of air!  :-)  (I''m sure this is a display of some sort rather than a rideable bike.)  Nice light, textures, tones.  Processed well to suit jagar''s style.</td>', 'Tires need a bit of air!  :-)  (I''m sure this is a display of some sort rather than a rideable bike.)  Nice light, textures, tones.  Processed well to suit jagar''s style.', '2013-02-18 12:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981135, 1053026, 30982, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a bit of e301, who hasn''t graced DPC with his presence for a very long time.</td>', 'Reminds me a bit of e301, who hasn''t graced DPC with his presence for a very long time.', '2013-02-18 12:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981136, 1052963, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great backdrop!</td>', 'Great backdrop!', '2013-02-18 12:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981137, 1053499, 30982, '<td valign="top">This works so beautifully for this challenge - and just as a photograph in its own right.  A nice touch of life - all the humans staying inside where it''s warm and cozy.  Excellent tones.</td>', 'This works so beautifully for this challenge - and just as a photograph in its own right.  A nice touch of life - all the humans staying inside where it''s warm and cozy.  Excellent tones.', '2013-02-18 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981138, 1053478, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, in two distinct halves.  Maybe a touch too much glow but has a nice feel to it.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, in two distinct halves.  Maybe a touch too much glow but has a nice feel to it.', '2013-02-18 12:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981139, 1053442, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!!  Perfect!  Such different views, but all moustached.  The "is it real or is it memorex" guy in the back is wonderful!  I''d wager this is the actual jagar, and if not, you''ve captured the essence of his work well enough to make him worry, I''d wager!</td>', 'Heh!!  Perfect!  Such different views, but all moustached.  The "is it real or is it memorex" guy in the back is wonderful!  I''d wager this is the actual jagar, and if not, you''ve captured the essence of his work well enough to make him worry, I''d wager!', '2013-02-18 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981140, 1053487, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a French title.  :-)  Fun scene - Rockwell-esque!</td>', 'Nice use of a French title.  :-)  Fun scene - Rockwell-esque!', '2013-02-18 12:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981143, 1053392, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a smart dog!  Lovely slice of life shot.</td>', 'What a smart dog!  Lovely slice of life shot.', '2013-02-18 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981144, 1053320, 30982, '<td valign="top">If jagar and PennyStreet hooked up to shoot, this is what you''d get!  Love the busy-ness of the environment, and the classic PennyStreet crosswalk stripes.</td>', 'If jagar and PennyStreet hooked up to shoot, this is what you''d get!  Love the busy-ness of the environment, and the classic PennyStreet crosswalk stripes.', '2013-02-18 12:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981145, 1053106, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent light theft!</td>', 'Excellent light theft!', '2013-02-18 12:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981146, 1053432, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh how poignant!  Very well seen.</td>', 'Oh how poignant!  Very well seen.', '2013-02-18 12:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981147, 1053011, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great light, nice balance between all the element.</td>', 'Great light, nice balance between all the element.', '2013-02-18 12:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981148, 1053454, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great smile!  I like your composition - it deals with the "busy" factor well.</td>', 'What a great smile!  I like your composition - it deals with the "busy" factor well.', '2013-02-18 12:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981149, 1053542, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent smile!</td>', 'An excellent smile!', '2013-02-18 12:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981151, 1053273, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an excellent backdrop! One wonders if the gent behind is carrying the basket for the robed gent, or if their paths just happen to collide at this moment.</td>', 'What an excellent backdrop! One wonders if the gent behind is carrying the basket for the robed gent, or if their paths just happen to collide at this moment.', '2013-02-18 12:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981152, 1053528, 30982, '<td valign="top">What kind and gentle eyes.</td>', 'What kind and gentle eyes.', '2013-02-18 12:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981153, 1053039, 30982, '<td valign="top">If Jagar met up with Mariuca, this is what you''d get.  Marvelous natural diptych!</td>', 'If Jagar met up with Mariuca, this is what you''d get.  Marvelous natural diptych!', '2013-02-18 12:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981154, 1053241, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how these tow do not seem to be "together" but just two souls having coffee at the same time in the same place.  The dog knows all, though.</td>', 'I like how these tow do not seem to be "together" but just two souls having coffee at the same time in the same place.  The dog knows all, though.', '2013-02-18 12:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981155, 1053215, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the star of the flash!  Especially like the mirrored world.  Really a nice moment.</td>', 'Love the star of the flash!  Especially like the mirrored world.  Really a nice moment.', '2013-02-18 12:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981156, 1053250, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s well-stocked and has a pretty nice ride there!</td>', 'He''s well-stocked and has a pretty nice ride there!', '2013-02-18 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981157, 1053187, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet moment captured!</td>', 'Sweet moment captured!', '2013-02-18 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981158, 1053540, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome light!!  Lovely texture study with that nice jagar-esque vignette.</td>', 'Awesome light!!  Lovely texture study with that nice jagar-esque vignette.', '2013-02-18 12:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981160, 1053342, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice with the "pensive" feel of some of Jagar''s work.  I like this all on its own as well.</td>', 'Really nice with the "pensive" feel of some of Jagar''s work.  I like this all on its own as well.', '2013-02-18 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981162, 1053406, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the white socks! Also really like the reflection in the window.  Nicely structured and set out.</td>', 'Love the white socks! Also really like the reflection in the window.  Nicely structured and set out.', '2013-02-18 13:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981163, 1053449, 30982, '<td valign="top">The bird in the perfect place!  That''s a comment John once gave me about some of my shots, so I''m quite envious of this one!</td>', 'The bird in the perfect place!  That''s a comment John once gave me about some of my shots, so I''m quite envious of this one!', '2013-02-18 13:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981165, 1053111, 30982, '<td valign="top">An amazing combination of Jagar meets Norman Rockwell in PennyStreet style.  It''s the crosswalk lines that secure the image but the snowflakes that give it life.</td>', 'An amazing combination of Jagar meets Norman Rockwell in PennyStreet style.  It''s the crosswalk lines that secure the image but the snowflakes that give it life.', '2013-02-18 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981175, 1053426, 63218, '<td valign="top">IMO that white horiz. line across the top is not doing this comp any favors, mainly because of that other white line that is part of the comp. I didn''t see it, though, until after I enjoyed the light on the roadway, &amp; the shadows.</td>', 'IMO that white horiz. line across the top is not doing this comp any favors, mainly because of that other white line that is part of the comp. I didn''t see it, though, until after I enjoyed the light on the roadway, & the shadows.', '2013-02-18 13:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
