(6982052, 1053487, 114285, '<td valign="top">Ohh to frolic in the snow again. We did this when we went to Canada, the kids loved it so much, my boy threw a snowball at me...the snow penetrated up my nose and felt like it gave me brain freeze. I never laughed so much, I couldn''t be angry at him. Thanks for all the memories, I adore this shot, the light is amazing, the tree is stunning it really makes the shot.<br/> <br/>I''m faving it!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a>adorable</td>', 'Ohh to frolic in the snow again. We did this when we went to Canada, the kids loved it so much, my boy threw a snowball at me...the snow penetrated up my nose and felt like it gave me brain freeze. I never laughed so much, I couldn''t be angry at him. Thanks for all the memories, I adore this shot, the light is amazing, the tree is stunning it really makes the shot. I''m faving it! adorable', '2013-02-19 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
