(6982574, 1053524, 71489, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations. I think this shot is way better than my entry. You have perfect focus with a very interesting subject. Well done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>well no ways! Your shot is manually focused! And still so awesome. I''m not even in your league! :) congratulations to you too!</td>', 'Originally posted by Dennisheckman: Congratulations. I think this shot is way better than my entry. You have perfect focus with a very interesting subject. Well done!   well no ways! Your shot is manually focused! And still so awesome. I''m not even in your league! :) congratulations to you too!', '2013-02-20 17:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
