(6982711, 1053111, 138630, '<td valign="top">A top score and favorite for me, too.  The tones, the tones.  Wonderful, Penny.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'A top score and favorite for me, too.  The tones, the tones.  Wonderful, Penny.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2013-02-20 21:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982712, 1053099, 138630, '<td valign="top">What''s cool about this is that both subjects work together in the context yet are obviously separate individuals - if you know what I mean.  The story is here.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'What''s cool about this is that both subjects work together in the context yet are obviously separate individuals - if you know what I mean.  The story is here.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2013-02-20 21:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6982713, 1053528, 138630, '<td valign="top">This was my top pick - a wonderful portrait in every way: subject, framing, detail, tones.  Congratulations on the HM.<br/>eta Do you know I never noticed the softness of the nose until this very minute when I read YOUR apology about focus and went back to see what you meant.  That''s now strongly the personality and processing carried this for me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-20 21:56:42.</i></td>', 'This was my top pick - a wonderful portrait in every way: subject, framing, detail, tones.  Congratulations on the HM.eta Do you know I never noticed the softness of the nose until this very minute when I read YOUR apology about focus and went back to see what you meant.  That''s now strongly the personality and processing carried this for me.', '2013-02-20 21:55:19.000000', '2013-02-20 21:56:42.000000', 0),
