(6984901, 1053503, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is classic and beautiful.</td>', 'This is classic and beautiful.', '2013-02-23 23:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984907, 1053553, 30982, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this image is the sign telling us (and her, I suppose) to go around to the right of the median.  Because after that very helpful advice, you see to the two gents upper right, arms crossed, just hanging out, then the guy left of sign who in this 800 pixel wide version appears to be walking a small elephant statue.  Add this to the pasta/sushi/liquor store combination and you have one amazing collection of coincidences, and coincidence is one of those jagar hallmarks.</td>', 'My favorite part of this image is the sign telling us (and her, I suppose) to go around to the right of the median.  Because after that very helpful advice, you see to the two gents upper right, arms crossed, just hanging out, then the guy left of sign who in this 800 pixel wide version appears to be walking a small elephant statue.  Add this to the pasta/sushi/liquor store combination and you have one amazing collection of coincidences, and coincidence is one of those jagar hallmarks.', '2013-02-23 23:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984922, 1053544, 30982, '<td valign="top">A model?  You used a model??  Ah, I''ll forgive you.  The lovely balance between light and shadow makes the location worthy of stuffing a model in there.</td>', 'A model?  You used a model??  Ah, I''ll forgive you.  The lovely balance between light and shadow makes the location worthy of stuffing a model in there.', '2013-02-24 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6984964, 1053523, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this.  Her direct gaze - a bit of a challenge, perhaps - make this rather powerful.  And I agree with Timothy - love all the fences.</td>', 'I quite like this.  Her direct gaze - a bit of a challenge, perhaps - make this rather powerful.  And I agree with Timothy - love all the fences.', '2013-02-24 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 0),
